  "properties": {
    "title": "TiPg: a Simple and Fast OGC Features and Tiles API for PostGIS.",
    "description": "Following the work we did with TiTiler (a python module which is designed to create Raster services), we decided to develop the same kind of project but for Vector. Using Postgres/PostGIS as datasource and FastAPI/Pydantic for the web framework, TiPG is a lightweight application which user can include into their own FastAPI application and easily customized. \r\n\r\nDuring this session I'll go over the design principle of the TiPg python module and also show some of its great features.",
